I updated all my patches for version 3.4.2. Most of them converted
with absolutely no problems, but there were one or two little changes
in the code that made me have to work a bit.
As always you can get the patches and some precompiled Windows
binaries at my website. ( http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky )

Quick rundown of my patches:

Color alchemy:
Implements alchemy with mixing rules based on potion color rather than
type.
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/alchemy-desc.html

Bag of tricks enhancement:
Bag of tricks are made a little more interesting than a wand of create
monster.
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/tricks-desc.html

Vacuum cleaner:
Adds a vacuum cleaner object, making dungeon cleanup quick and easy!
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/vacuum-desc.html

Photography:
Implements photography with the expensive camera. Make great
souvenirs!
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/photo-desc.html

Grudge:
Makes monsters who don't like each other fight (e.g. elves and orcs).
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/grudge-desc.html

Invisible Objects:
Implements invisible objects.
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/invis-objects-desc.html

Free Cookie:
Szechuan tins have a chance of containing a free fortune cookie.
http://www.geocities.com/zindorsky/patches/cookie-desc.html

All:
A composite patch.

